      "text": "SN24 fell 70% today. Everyone's looking for the whale. There wasn't just one\ud83d\udd0d\n\n522 wallets sold. The top 5 were only 12% of the flow \u2014 this was a crowded exit, not a single seller.\n\nWhat was actually visible beforehand:\n\n\ud83d\udd34 Overheating climbed 4 days straight: 0.88 \u2192 1.11 \u2192 1.79 \u2192 2.63 \n\ud83d\udd34 Our signals flagged SN24 as FADE on 29 July, three days before the drop \n\ud83d\udfe1 24h volume hit 7.4\u00d7 the entire pool depth \n\ud83d\udfe1 Insiders sent 1,360 bittensor:native to exchanges over 30 days, net \u2212732 \u03c4\n\nAnd the part that stings: holders grew +173 in the same 4 days the signal was screaming. Insiders left quietly for a month, new holders arrived for the top.\n\nWe publish these flags before the move, then score them \u2192 https://t.co/kuo2fXqFCg",
